{"code":0,"message":"success","data":[{"id":30,"conversation_id":19,"role":"user","message_type":"text","content":"库存和客户应收情况","structured_data_json":null,"created_at":1783227144342},{"id":31,"conversation_id":19,"role":"assistant","message_type":"text","content":"库存和客户应收情况如下：\n\n1. 库存方面：最近库存快照 0 条，库存总值 ¥0.00，当前查询没有查到库存记录。\n2. 客户应收方面：欠款客户总数 0 个，应收总额 ¥0.00，Top10 应收合计 ¥0.00，当前没有查到客户应收欠款。\n\n可执行建议：\n1. 先确认是否已录入库存快照；如果是新账号或未做盘点，建议先补充库存数据。\n2. 定期检查客户应收登记，确保销售开单、收款和对账记录完整。\n3. 如果你希望，我可以继续帮你查“近期出入库”“具体商品库存”或“客户欠款明细”。\n查询边界：inventory_snapshot_lookup最多查询 10 条，实际返回 0 条；客户应收查询最多查询 10 条，实际返回 0 条。","structured_data_json":"[{\"block_type\":\"kpi_grid\",\"title\":\"库存快照概览\",\"data\":{\"kpis\":[{\"label\":\"快照条数\",\"value\":\"0\",\"trend_direction\":\"flat\"},{\"label\":\"库存总量\",\"value\":\"0\",\"trend_direction\":\"flat\"},{\"label\":\"库存总值\",\"value\":\"¥0.00\",\"trend_direction\":\"flat\"}]}},{\"block_type\":\"table\",\"title\":\"最近库存快照\",\"data\":{\"headers\":[\"商品\",\"编码\",\"库存\",\"单价\",\"总值\",\"快照日期\"],\"rows\":[],\"row_count\":0}},{\"block_type\":\"kpi_grid\",\"title\":\"应收概览\",\"data\":{\"kpis\":[{\"label\":\"欠款客户总数\",\"value\":\"0\",\"trend_direction\":\"flat\"},{\"label\":\"应收总额\",\"value\":\"¥0.00\",\"trend_direction\":\"flat\"},{\"label\":\"最高单户欠款\",\"value\":\"¥0.00\",\"trend_direction\":\"flat\"}]}},{\"block_type\":\"rank_list\",\"title\":\"欠款客户排行\",\"data\":{\"items\":[]}},{\"block_type\":\"evidence_card\",\"title\":\"本次回答依据\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"本次回答依据\",\"items\":[{\"label\":\"inventory_snapshot_lookup\",\"value\":\"最近库存快照 0 条，库存总值 ¥0.00\",\"source\":\"tool:inventory_snapshot_lookup\",\"tool_call_id\":\"9adb87b3-a68a-487f-a2be-5cf9a2d62355:inventory_snapshot_lookup\",\"query_window\":{\"started_at\":1783227151963,\"completed_at\":1783227152048,\"duration_ms\":85,\"returned_count\":0,\"limit\":10,\"is_truncated\":false,\"tool_name\":\"inventory_snapshot_lookup\",\"tool_input\":{\"snapshot_date\":null,\"product_id\":null,\"start_date\":null,\"end_date\":null}},\"is_